WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.690
A disaster took place in Ake Village.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:13.570
All the Kiba, the important Touda bestowed by the Grand Duke, died.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:20.370
Soyon, who was named responsible for the event, was taken away by the inspectors.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.920
MOM!

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.880
Power isn't everything.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.340
Yes, Ani-ue.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.800
The Grand Duke has wonderful sons.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:21.560
Shunan, with great skill.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.270
And Ngan, with great power.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:29.020
You two will eventually protect the Queen with your combined attributes.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.150
How promising.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:36.150
Damiya-sama, thank you greatly for coming all this way.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.320
However, our Father has gone out hawking.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.240
How beautiful.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:47.000
I'm sure this garden is one of the Grand Duke's prized treasures.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:53.300
Speaking of prized treasure, I heard some Kiba died.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.970
You have keen ears, Damiya-sama.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.720
It's better to learn what must be known sooner rather than later.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:06.640
To protect the Queen, I extend my eyes and ears to learn of the changes in the world.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.860
That's the duty given to those who inherit the blood of the Founding King, Je.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.400
How to make use of them, too.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.610
Ngan.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.280
What do you think of Damiya-sama?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.830
A great person.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.330
So much that he's dazzling.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.420
You're right.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:39.550
But the stronger the light, the darker the shadow becomes.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:50.020
Mother's Whistle

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.190
Look at this feast, Erin-chan.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.440
Eat this, and you'll have all the energy you'll need.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.400
Yeah...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.860
Itadakimasu.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.750
You've got to eat and cheer up, or else you'll make Soyon cry.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.790
Hey.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:24.300
So, why was this Mist Person taking care of the Grand Duke's important Kiba?!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.100
She has an exceptional skill with medicine.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:27.930
I bet.
She has an exceptional skill with medicine.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:28.720
I bet.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:32.980
Mist People are ones to employ mysterious spells.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.310
But Chief!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:39.280
Having exceptional skill is not the only thing sought from those who take care of Touda!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:44.780
The most important aspect is to have a relentless devotion to the Grand Duke!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.450
A chief of the Touda breeders doesn't even know that?!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.540
With all due respect, if I may speak.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:57.500
This woman was exiled from the Mist People over ten years ago,

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.670
married my son, and became part of our village.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:07.010
She no longer abides by the code of the Mist People and is loyal to the Grand Duke.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:13.230
That's strange.  I hear that Mist People even kill their children if they disobey their code.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:18.730
Chief!  How did the Kiba that were being taken care of by <i>only</i> this Mist Person die?!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.160
The cause of the Kiba's deaths was poison.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.660
"Poison?"

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.290
What were you feeding the Kiba?!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.840
Please wait.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:46.140
Without a doubt, what she was feeding them was benetrophic water.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.510
Out of the way, Chief!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.930
I-I agree...

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.770
I'm sure it was benetrophic water.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.440
I'm sure of it, too.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.150
Silence, you two!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:05:00.650
The chemical components in benetrophic water are strong.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:08.660
However, to refrain from hurting their health, we are only capable of giving them food with good nutrients

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:14.410
after the mucus coating the Touda's body and the benetrophic water have mixed and entered their system.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:19.710
I saw no abnormality during the night patrol,

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:27.130
but when I examined the Touda corpses in the morning, the mucus was dilute in places.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.720
How did such a change happen over the course of a few hours?

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.520
I do not know.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.730
Put her on Touda Trial.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.740
As you say.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.710
<i>This isn't good?</i>

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.550
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:11.470
<i>Polish balls can't be too hard, nor too soft.</i>

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>Here.  A toughness similar to the thumb joint is what you want.</i>

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.600
<i>Okay.</i>

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.740
The bracelet Mom gave me...

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.830
Erin-chan...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.870
Soyon was taken to Lagoe Swamp?

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.630
So she's going to be put on Touda Trial in the morning?

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.340
"Touda Trial?"

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.710
Shh!  Not so loud.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.720
What are you going to do if the kids wake up?

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.340
But that's too inhumane.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.800
It's horrible to give her a death sentence of being eaten by wild Touda.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.060
"Death sentence?"

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.620
Erin-chan!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.080
Where are you going?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.370
Erin-chan!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:26.170
I bet you curse me now, Soyon.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.340
No, I don't.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:34.850
If I hadn't allowed you to marry Asson, then you would have remained one of the Mist People.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:47.730
He's the one who showed me the path to nurturing and love, and walked with an Aowrow like me, who was once a vagabond.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.740
I regret nothing.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.280
I would not curse you, either.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.990
Soyon...

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.790
Please take care of her.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.630
Very well.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:19.770
<i>Erin.</i>

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.190
<i>This polish ball is very well made.</i>

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.350
<i>Really?</i>

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.360
<i>Yes.</i>

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.770
Erin-chan!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.860
Erin-chan!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.870
There's no way I'll be able to see Mom if they find me.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.620
I've got to get the bracelet.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.840
Erin-chan!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.340
Erin-chan?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.810
Look.  This is Erin-chan's footprint.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.480
She's not in the bedroom, either.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.600
Where could she have gone to?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.070
When the morning comes, Mom will...

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.700
Mom.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.450
As I thought, I can't get out through the gate.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.170
Maybe I can go through there.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.020
Mom...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.200
As Erin went down the cliff, she was thinking,

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:04.790
"Once I save Mom, we can both leave the village and live while traveling.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.960
Just like Mom used to do."

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.750
Hang in there, Mom.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.840
Erin.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.960
Mom...

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.800
<i>Green eyes... </i>

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.840
<i>You must be a daughter of the Mist People.</i>

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.720
Mom...

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:05.390
<i>I decided to never associate with the Mist People.</i>

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.850
Mom...

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.480
Mo-

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.190
What's this sound?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:56.480
It's about time for the unhappy Touda awakened by the gong to have gathered.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.570
Take the criminal up there.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.540
I'm sorry, but...

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.710
Please take care of the Touda in the village.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.500
You've got it.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:27.970
Tie it at this height.  Make sure to tie it tight so it won't undo when she hits the water.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.650
It's going to be morning soon.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.570
Mom!  Mom!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.900
Mom!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.450
God, it's so noisy!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.250
What's all the noise for?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.620
I can't sleep at all.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.210
I'll give them a piece of me.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.000
Look, there's a person standing there.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.210
You're right.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.260
Oh, crap.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.510
That's the Grand Duke's army.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.220
They must have come to arrest us.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.890
We've got to run!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.730
Mom!  Mom!

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.440
Mokku!  She's...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.060
It's the girl from that day!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.720
Nassan.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.620
Mom!!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.610
They've come out.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:53.530
A-Are they having the Touda feed on that person they dropped?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.500
T-That's horrible!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.550
Mom!!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.140
Mom!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.560
Erin?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.600
Mom!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.600
What is that?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.440
Looks like a child.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.110
Mom!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.020
That's Erin!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.320
It's fine.  That's unnecessary.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.110
Look.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.540
The Touda have already surrounded them and are fighting over their food.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.960
Soon they'll pounce on them in the order of the strongest.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.920
She won't survive.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:52.800
Ani!  We've got to do something, or else she'll be eaten, too!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.720
Well what?!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:59.180
Mom!  I'll save you now!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.100
Erin...  What have you done...?

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.900
Chief.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.900
This might be for the best.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.530
Mom, I'll free you with this now.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.200
Erin...

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.080
I'm already...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:31.010
But you should...

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.760
I can't watch this!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.970
I can't either!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.410
Erin...

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:04.500
Hang on tight, Erin.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.630
You must never do what I'm about to do.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:14.930
Since I'm about to commit an unforgivable crime.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.100
No, she isn't!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.480
What's that?

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.730
The Touda aren't moving.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.120
What is going on?

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.620
Soyon...  You've...

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:48.120
What is that?  What is that woman doing?

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:51.420
It looks like she's finger whistling.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.300
Why aren't the Touda moving?

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.380
Can such a thing be done with a finger whistle?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:00.510
Not as far as I know.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.720
Wild Touda cannot be petrified using the mute whistle, either.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.640
Much less, just with a finger whistle.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.030
Mom!  The Touda are...!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.860
Don't worry.  Here, Erin.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.070
Grab the horn.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.280
Like this?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.950
Don't let go of the horns, you hear?

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.040
You need to come, too.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.880
Live.  And find your happiness.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.100
Mom!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.060
Mom!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.480
Mom!  Mom!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.650
Mom!
Look straight ahead!  Don't look back!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.570
Look straight ahead!  Don't look back!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.990
T-That's...

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.450
Mom!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.370
My...

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.370
Mom!  Mom!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:10.870
Erin...

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.750
Mom!
Erin...

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.340
Mom!

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:17.960
<i>Mom.</i>

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:20.630
<i>What do I smell like?</i>

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.470
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.100
<i>Smells like the sun.</i>

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:32.060
<i>Your father was like the sun, too, when he smiled.</i>

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:37.030
<i>Smells... like the sun...</i>

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:45.990
Asson...

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.840
My daughter...

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:08.640
Mom...

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.230
Mom!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.510
Mom!  Mom!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:50.180
Mom!  Mom!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.950
<i>I was planning on giving it to you when you grew up.</i>

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:16.460
<i>Laco leaves can be found anywhere in any season, so while I was traveling, I often used it like this to cook.</i>

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.220
<i>Is it good?</i>

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.720
Mom...

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.000
"Mom...  Mom..."

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:08.300
As her mind drifted away, Erin continued to call for her mother.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:12.930
Soyon was no longer able to answer her calls.

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:19.310
With the bracelet shining in the clear morning sun's rays,

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:27.030
Erin was carried away by a Touda to an unknown world, all alone.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:10.890
I was washed away to a shore away from Ake Village, where sallow flowers bloom, on the back of a Touda.

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:17.310
The person who rescued me from the sadness of losing Mom, the pain from my wounds, as well as my fever

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:20.810
was a big old man who carried the scent of honey.

00:24:21.290 --> 00:24:25.040
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Jone the Honey Man.

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:30.020
Jone the Honey Man
